{"id":"wb-7-1934","name":"克拉玛依一号井","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"克拉玛依一号井","text":"克拉玛依一号井，原称黑油山一号井，简称克一号井或一号井，是从克拉玛依油田发掘的第一口油井，位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区克拉玛依市克拉玛依区。\n克拉玛依一号井是全国重点文物保护单位、国家工业遗产、全国红色旅游经典景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%8B%E6%8B%89%E7%8E%9B%E4%BE%9D%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%B7%E4%BA%95","revisionId":94059454,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94059454","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6e7498de5c5783cc0c75505d.jpg","title":"克拉玛依一号井.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%85%8B%E6%8B%89%E7%8E%9B%E4%BE%9D%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%B7%E4%BA%95.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/%E5%85%8B%E6%8B%89%E7%8E%9B%E4%BE%9D%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%B7%E4%BA%95.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​克拉玛依一号井","width":320,"height":256}}